# RL Experiment History — {{BENCHMARK_NAME}}

Legacy append-only ledger from the deprecated `/rl-experiment` skill. Kept for
back-compat with older trial dirs. The current rl-tuning-agent writes per-tune
state under `harbor/rl-experiment/<tune_id>/<wandb_project>/tuning-history.md`,
and `/harbor:rl-tune` writes a tune-level rollup at
`harbor/rl-experiment/<tune_id>/history.md`. Per-trial detail still
lives in `harbor/rl_experiments/runs/<trial_id>/`.

